              </section>
              <section class="resume-section-card">
                <h4>Perisian</h4>
                <ul><li>Visual Studio Code & Cisco Packet Tracer</li><li>Canva & aplikasi video editing</li><li>Microsoft Word, PowerPoint & asas Excel</li></ul>
